{"id":"500434","name":"白萝卜鱼汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/500434/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"鲈鱼","amount":"适量(头，尾，骨)"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜削皮洗净切厚片。","img":"images/500434/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"热锅放油，下姜丝，鱼头，尾，骨煎香。","img":"images/500434/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量的水大火煮沸。","img":"images/500434/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"下白萝卜片，4粒红枣，煮15分钟。","img":"images/500434/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切点葱花。","img":"images/500434/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"调少许胡椒粉，盐，再煮1分钟，撒下葱花完成了。","img":"images/500434/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/500434/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/500434/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}